[32m[K1165[m[K[36m[K-[m[K
[32m[K1166[m[K[36m[K-[m[K    The following code implements a compaction algorithm that is similar to
[32m[K1167[m[K[36m[K-[m[K    Edward's Two-Finger algorithm from the original 1974 LISP book (The
[32m[K1168[m[K[36m[K-[m[K    Programming Language LISP). At a high level the algorithm works as a series
[32m[K1169[m[K[36m[K-[m[K    of parallel (using all running domains) phases separated by global barriers:
[32m[K1170[m[K[36m[K-[m[K
[32m[K1171[m[K[36m[K-[m[K    1. For each size class
[32m[K1172[m[K[36m[K-[m[K      a. Compute the number of live blocks in partially filled pools
