[32m[K1180[m[K[36m[K-[m[K    3. Go through pools evacuated and release them. Finally free all but
[32m[K1181[m[K[36m[K-[m[K        one pool in the freelist.
[32m[K1182[m[K[36m[K-[m[K    4. One domain needs to release the pools in the freelist back to the OS.
[32m[K1183[m[K[36m[K-[m[K
[32m[K1184[m[K[36m[K-[m[K    The algorithm requires one full pass through the whole heap (pools and large
[32m[K1185[m[K[36m[K-[m[K    allocations) to rewrite pointers, as well as two passes through the
[32m[K1186[m[K[36m[K-[m[K    partially-occupied pools in the heap to compute the number of live blocks
